cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Parkinson's Disease Motion & Gait Visualization"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and the underlying datasets
  (PPMI and Synapse WearGait-PD).
type: software
authors:
  - name: "CVC Lab, Oden Institute, The University of Texas at Austin"
repository-code: "https://github.com/CVC-Lab/parkinson-viz"
url: "https://cvc-lab.github.io/parkinson-viz/"
abstract: >-
  An interactive 3D visualization of Parkinson's disease gait and arm-swing
  asymmetry from the PPMI cohort, with IMU-derived real-motion clips from the
  Synapse WearGait-PD dataset.
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Parkinson's Progression Markers Initiative (PPMI)"
    url: "https://www.ppmi-info.org/"
  - type: data
    title: "Synapse WearGait-PD dataset"
    url: "https://www.synapse.org/"
